 *(2) Schedule 1, item 16, page 7 (lines 6 to 15), omit subsection 367C(2), substitute:* > >> *(2) An application made to the ART for review of a reviewable migration decision is an application to be reviewed on the papers if the decision is a decision to refuse to grant a student visa.* > > *(3) Schedule 1, item 16, page 7 (lines 23 to 27), omit subsection 367C(4), substitute:* > >> *Regulations* >> >> *(4) Without limiting paragraph (3)(b), regulations made for the purposes of that paragraph may prescribe circumstances relating to applications made before, on or after the commencement of those regulations.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-9891","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2026-02-05/2"}
